---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Lonus">
	<main class="min-h-[85vh] max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-[#E4DCF4]/90 font-['Poppins']">
		<a
			href="/"
			class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-8 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-[#E4DCF4]/70 hover:text-white bg-[#16141a] border border-[#4D465D]/60 hover:border-green-500 transition-all duration-150"
		>
			&larr; Back to Bio
		</a>

		<h1 class="text-white text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
		<div class="w-20 min-h-[3px] bg-green-500 rounded-2xl mb-8"></div>

		<div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#E4DCF4]/80">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">1. Overview</h2>
				<p>
					These Terms of Service govern your purchase and use of digital products, code templates, guides, and software assets provided by Hatsalsa, Inc. ("we", "us", or "our") through this website. By completing a transaction, you agree to be bound by these terms.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">2. Merchant of Record</h2>
				<p>
					Our order process may be conducted by our online reseller and Merchant of Record, Dodo Payments (or other designated authorized reseller), who processes payments, calculates applicable taxes, handles currency conversions, and manages customer billing inquiries.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">3. Digital Products & Delivery</h2>
				<p>
					All items offered on this storefront are digital-only products, licenses, and in-app features (such as premium themes, customization assets, and software unlocks). Delivery occurs electronically immediately upon payment confirmation via in-app activation, license key, or digital access grant. No physical products are shipped.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">4. License & Permitted Use</h2>
				<p>
					Upon purchase, you are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to download and utilize the purchased digital assets for personal and commercial projects. You may not sublicense, resell, redistribute, or package the source assets into a competing marketplace or digital bundle.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">5. Pricing & Payments</h2>
				<p>
					Prices are listed in USD (or local equivalent) and are subject to change without notice. All applicable sales tax, VAT, or GST will be calculated and displayed during checkout by the Merchant of Record.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">6. Contact Information</h2>
				<p>
					For any questions regarding these Terms, please contact our support team at <a href="mailto:support@hatsalsa.com" class="text-green-400 hover:underline">support@hatsalsa.com</a>.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
	html {
		background-color: #0a0b0f;
	}
</style>
